# To review is one list in three sections, by how far the viewer has got with each PR: those
# they haven't reviewed, those they're part way through, and those they've approved. It sits
# beside Mine in a split the viewer can resize. The fixtures hold no reviews of the viewer's,
# so every PR waits in the first section.
wait settled
open lists
expect text "Mine (19)" exists
expect AXHeading "To review (13)" in list 2 exists
expect button ~"atrium #2928" in list 2 exists
expect list count 2
expect AXSplitter exists
snap review-columns

# The other two sections follow the first's PRs, each saying it's empty.
scroll list 2 down 20000
wait until AXHeading "Approved (0)" in list 2 exists
expect AXHeading "Reviewing (0)" in list 2 exists
expect text "Nothing here" in list 2 count 2
snap review-columns-end
